CCAAVVEEAATTSS
     The rrffccoommmm__ppppppdd utility in server mode will try to register the Bluetooth
     LAN Access Over PPP service with the local SDP daemon.  If the local SDP
     daemon is not running, rrffccoommmm__ppppppdd will exit with an error.

